@api = http://localhost:3001

### Health and chunk count
GET {{api}}/health

### Grounded answer (troubleshooting)
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-1",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "My Aurora is showing E03, what should I do?" }]
}

### Policy nuance (opened grinder return)
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-2",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Can I return a grinder I've already used?" }]
}

### Follow-up that relies on conversation history
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-3",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "How long is the warranty on the Aurora?" },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "The Aurora has a 2-year warranty, extended to 3 years if you register it within 60 days of delivery [1]." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "And the grinder?" }
  ]
}

### Not in the docs: should say it doesn't know and offer a human
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-4",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Do you ship to Canada?" }]
}

### Off-topic: should politely decline
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-5",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Write me a poem about the stock market" }]
}
